## Patch title (slug stays the same) - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "A New Title"
}

###
## Patch content - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "An edited post that is still over thirty characters."
}

###
## Publish - expect 200, publishedAt set
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "publish": true
}

###
## Unpublish - expect 200, publishedAt null
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "publish": false
}

###
## Empty body, every field optional via PartialType - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
## Changing the author (omitted from PatchPostDto) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "authorId": 2
}

###
## content too short (@MinLength(30)) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Too short"
}

###
## Unknown post id - expect 404
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "A New Title"
}

###
## Non-numeric id (ParseIntPipe) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "A New Title"
}
